## Title: |cFFD700Tetsu's|r Daily Writ Precrafter
## Author: Tetsurion
## Description: Daily writ crafter for heavy crafters with option to craft for several dailies ahead. Disable Dolgubon's Lazy Writ Creator first. Both on - conflict. Modes in settings: Default: crafts only the active writ (nothing if you have none). Pre-craft (click R3 on station): 1-10 dailies on every station. Auto-accept, turn-in, open reward boxes. Checks mats and bag space before crafting. Need writ craft for 1 day only? Use better Lazy Writ instead.
## Version: 2.5.2
## AddOnVersion: 25002
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
